  "description": "Speed and velocity (দ্রুতি এবং বেগ, pages 40–41, 2.5) as one guided ride, the book's own example: a cyclist rides from A to B along the winding road of চিত্র ২.০৪ in 20 minutes (shown faster). The road behind fills blue (দূরত্ব), the panel counts the distance and the time, and an outlined arrow on the cycle shows the direction of its velocity turning with the road while the speed stays the same. At B the straight orange সরণ arrow A→B appears (2 km, north-east), then the panel compares গড় দ্রুতি = মোট অতিক্রান্ত দূরত্ব ÷ মোট সময় = 4 km ÷ 20 min = 12 km/h (no direction) with গড় বেগ = সরণ ÷ সময় = 2 km ÷ 20 min = 6 km/h towards the north-east: every motion, winding or not, has both. A chip repeats the ride on a straight road (দূরত্ব = সরণ, so গড় দ্রুতি = গড় বেগের মান). Test: 5 tap questions (does a winding motion have a velocity, a book-style calculation, velocity on a bend, the straight road, a ride there and back). Phone-first, Bangla. GLB: the plain, the roads, the cyclist and the arrows; distances to scale, the cycle drawn 210 times bigger.",
